    dct:description "DOIs for Turing 1952, Aizenberg 2005, Weaver 2007, Monn 2015, and Sundar 2003 were resolved on Crossref/OpenAlex on 2026-10-27. The specimen is the NOAA Okeanos Explorer public-domain file, SHA-256 574b8094… pinned in the reference JSON and checked at runtime. Scout records that slot 3224 is not in the 100-slot campaign file, so the query path was used, and that the 51 µm sibling is a different filename." ;
